@startuml document_processing_sequence
skinparam shadowing false

title Processing sequence — PDDL engine

actor User
participant "Frontend\n(Web/Telegram/CLI, via REST API)" as Front
participant "PddlAccessibilityOrchestrator\nlibs/core/src/acessilia_core/pipeline/orchestrator.py" as Orchestrator
participant "ToolboxManifestExtractor\nlibs/core/src/acessilia_core/manifest" as Manifest
participant "PlannerAgent\nlibs/core/src/acessilia_core/planning" as Planner
participant "ExecutorAgent\n(Agno Workflow)" as Executor
participant "VisionAgent / DataAgent\n(Agno LLM)" as Agents
participant "Acessilia Toolbox\n(via acessilia-sdk)" as Toolbox
participant "Canonical builder\nlibs/core/src/acessilia_core/pipeline" as Builder
participant "Renderers\nlibs/core/src/acessilia_core/export" as Export
participant "Pure serializers\nlibs/docstruct/export" as PureExport
participant "Shared walker\ndocstruct.export.walk" as Walker

User -> Front: Upload a document (PDF/image)
Front -> Orchestrator: execute(file_path)

Orchestrator -> Manifest: extract(document)
Manifest -> Toolbox: structure extraction (regions, tables, OCR)
Toolbox --> Manifest: structure
Manifest --> Orchestrator: processing manifest (elements + obligations)

Orchestrator -> Planner: plan(manifest)
Planner --> Orchestrator: validated PDDL plan

Orchestrator -> Executor: run(plan, manifest)
loop each plan step
  alt deterministic method
    Executor -> Executor: docstruct algorithm
  else Toolbox method
    Executor -> Toolbox: capability (pdf.render, math.recognize, ...)
    Toolbox --> Executor: result
  else AI method
    Executor -> Agents: describe image / structure table or formula
    Agents --> Executor: typed output
  end
end
Executor --> Orchestrator: execution report

note over Orchestrator, Toolbox
  A Toolbox failure is retried or fails over, then fails
  the job with an explicit error: there is no local fallback.
end note

Orchestrator -> Builder: build_canonical_document()
Builder --> Orchestrator: validated canonical document

note over Builder, Export
  The canonical JSON Schema ships in docstruct's wheel.
  The builder returns dictionaries; legacy dataclasses remain
  compatibility exports, deprecated since 0.5.3 (ADR-0024).
  Builder/schema parity is tested, including child sections.
  Existing export audit applies; strict schema-gate activation
  remains separate (E1.2b, ADR-0023).
end note

Orchestrator -> Export: render formats
loop requested pure exports (TXT, HTML, Pandoc AST, benchmark Markdown)
  Export -> PureExport: canonical document, format options
  PureExport -> Walker: walk(document, visitor, select)
  Walker -> PureExport: section hooks and per-type/default callbacks
  PureExport --> Walker: rendered values (no I/O)
  Walker --> PureExport: ordered results
  PureExport --> Export: text / HTML / AST / Markdown
end
note over PureExport, Walker
  Each serializer keeps its current omission/filter policy.
  HTML filters the collected blocks before rendering.
end note
Export -> Toolbox: PDF/UA render
Export --> Front: accessible files (TXT, DOCX, PDF, PDF/UA, HTML, MP3)
Front --> User: deliver the accessible document

@enduml
